T ¶ Let us pray.
I WE humbly beseech thee, O Father, mer-
  cifully to look upon our infirmities;
  and for the glory of thy Name, turn from us
  all those evils that we most righteously have de-
  served; and grant, that in all our troubles we
  may put our whole trust and confidence in thy
  mercy, and evermore serve thee in holiness
  and pureness of living, to thy honour and glo-
  ry, through our only Mediator and Advocate,
  Jesus Christ our Lord. __Amen.__
